      "Standard workweek is 6 working days + 1 weekly off (or 5+2 if configured); default is 1 weekly off per 7-day cycle.",
      "Day-of-week integers follow Python convention: 0=Monday through 6=Sunday.",
      "Hard constraints (client min_staffing on required operating days, approved leaves/comp-offs, no double-booking across incompatible shifts) always override soft preferences (preferred_weekly_off).",
      "Employees on 365_DAYS or DAILY_EXCEPT_PH brands still receive their mandatory weekly off; uncovered days are flagged as HARD coverage gaps or filled by assigned BACKUP/floater employees.",
      "Pod Leads (EMP-01..EMP-04) supervise pods and are excluded from routine primary queues, but appear as last-resort escalation recommendations when no associate backup is available."
    ]
